<title>ISRAEL: Israel's September CPI +0.4 pct vs +0.4 pct.  [corrected 09:42 gmt 16/10]</title>
<headline>Israel's September CPI +0.4 pct vs +0.4 pct.  [corrected 09:42 gmt 16/10]</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of</p>
<p>Statistics issued the following economic indicators:</p>
<p>ISRAEL CONSUMER PRICES   Sept 96   Aug 96    Sept 95</p>
<p>Month-on-month change     +0.4	 + 0.4     + 1.0 (corrects from + 0.1)</p>
<p>Year-on-year change	+11.4	 +12.0     + 8.8</p>
<p>Index (base 100=1993)    140.0	 139.4     125.7</p>
<p>Note: To compare previous indices based on 1987=100.0,</p>
<p>multiply indices from January 1994 by 2.421.</p>
</text>
